<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Inscrição - Semana de Tecnologia 2026</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --accent-color: #38bdf8;
            --accent-hover: #0284c7;
            --text-color: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        header {
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 2.5rem auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .content-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        label {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        input[type="text"],
        input[type="email"],
        select {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            color: #f8fafc;
            padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        }

        input[type="text"]:focus,
        input[type="email"]:focus,
        select:focus {
            border-color: var(--accent-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
        }

        .btn-submit {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: #0f172a;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1rem;
            padding: 0.85rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .btn-submit:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-hover);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-back {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 1.75rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-back:hover {
            transform: translateX(-4px);
        }

        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="/" class="logo">⚡ SemanaTech 2026</a>
            <nav>
                <a href="/">Início</a>
                <a href="/sobre">Sobre</a>
                <a href="/programacao">Programação</a>
                <a href="/contato">Contato</a>
                <a href="/admin/inscricao" style="color: var(--accent-color);">Inscrição</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <article class="content-card">
            <h1>Formulário de Inscrição</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Preencha seus dados para garantir sua vaga gratuita nos workshops e palestras do evento.</p>

            <!-- Formulário Estático Simulado -->
            <form action="#" method="POST" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Inscrição simulada realizada com sucesso!');">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="nome">Nome Completo:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="nome" name="nome" placeholder="Ex: Maria da Silva" required>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email">E-mail Institucional ou Pessoal:</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Ex: maria.silva@fatec.sp.gov.br" required>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="categoria">Categoria de Participante:</label>
                    <select id="categoria" name="categoria" required>
                        <option value="" disabled selected>Selecione sua categoria...</option>
                        <option value="estudante">Estudante de Graduação / Técnico</option>
                        <option value="professor">Professor / Pesquisador</option>
                        <option value="profissional">Profissional da Área de TI</option>
                        <option value="visitante">Comunidade Externa / Visitante</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Confirmar Inscrição</button>
            </form>

            <a href="/" class="btn-back">← Voltar para a Página Inicial</a>
        </article>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Semana de Tecnologia. Desenvolvido com Node.js, Express e EJS.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
